17 is too many for the main path UI. Keep the 17 internally as subnodes, but expose 5–7 master phases.

The best condensation is probably 7 phases because it preserves the logic without becoming vague.


This order is recommended based on what works for me In order to fully grasp a phase a good udnerstanding of the phase before is likely needed.

E.g. in order to take magickal work seriously, first you must prove to the intellect that it is not bullshit, thats essentially the path.
Yet there is a process of confronting your assumptions. I would say that the short cut is to have an open mind and believe that magick is not bullshit
yet thi e implications of such a truth has not integrated into reality. The first step as such is staying in one place.

Recommended 7-phase model
1. The Dashboard

Problem: ordinary consciousness mistakes its rendering for reality.
Contains old phases:
1 Dashboard Diagnosis
2 Physical De-solidification
3 Mind-as-Computer Critique
4 Nested Agency
5 Mechanicality

Core move:
Reality is not simply “what I think it is.” Matter, mind, perception, culture, and self are all more constructed/relational than assumed.

Function in site:
Breaks naïve realism, crude materialism, computational reductionism, and mechanical ego.

Label:

See the interface.

2. The Cut

Problem: even after intellectual deconstruction, the self-world process keeps running.
Contains old phases:
6 Dependent Arising
7 Madhyamaka
8 Dzogchen/Mahāmudrā

Core move:
See experience fabricating self/world in real time, then de-reify all views, then stop constructing liberation as an object.

Function:
This is the real contemplative heart.

Label:

Cut the selfing process.

This should be the most important phase.

3. The Word

Problem: the dashboard is linguistic; ordinary naming binds reality, proliferating nanananda's name and form world
Contains old phases:
9 Pramāṇa / Language / Mantra

But this phase can also link back to Phase 2 because Ñāṇananda already deals with name-and-form.

Core move:
Understand valid knowing, signs, speech, mantra, divine names, Logos, sphoṭa, and how language binds or liberates.

Function:
Bridge from Buddhist deconstruction into mantra, ritual speech, sacred names, AI/semantic graph, and essay ontology, Baudrillard
Logos, Gnostic gospels? Terrence mckenna dmt langauge, mostly sanskrit 

Label:

Purify language.

4. The Image

Problem: after deconstruction, imagination is either dismissed as fake or literalized.
Contains old phase:
10 Imaginal Reconstruction

Also includes rasa/aesthetics, dreams, Jung, Corbin, Hillman, Burbea.

Core move:
Recover image as empty but potent.

Function:
Makes dreams, symbols, daimon, active imagination, art, myth, and soulmaking usable without reification, rudolf steiner cognising nature, angels

Label:

Recover the imaginal.

5. The Ritual

Problem: insight remains mental unless embodied and ritualized.
Contains old phases:
11 Body-Energy
12 Ritual / Ceremonial Technology

Core move:
The body becomes the living interface; ritual orders body, space, sound, image, attention, and intention.

Function:
This is where yoga, tantra, nyāsa, deity yoga, Iamblichus, Golden Dawn, pūjā, homa, mantra practice, and safe ritual live.

Label:

Order the vessel.

6. Communion or Accessing other realities / entities

Problem: guidance is confused with fantasy, desire, inflation, or literal spirits.
Contains old phases:
13 Daimon / HGA / Perfect Nature
14 Nonordinary Rendering
15 Shamanism / Ecology
16 Visionary Cosmologies

Core move:
Engage guidance, dreams, nonordinary states, daimonic vocation, visionary maps, and more-than-human relation — but test everything by fruits.

Function:
This is the “oracle” layer, but heavily corrected by Phase 2.
Solidifies previous steps into communion with the immaterial

Label:

Listen without reifying.

7. Incarnation

Problem: spirituality remains private, abstract, or escapist.
Contains old phase:
17 Social / Historical Incarnation

Also links back to Marx, Hegel, , ecology, work, speech, money, service, skill, culture.

Core move:
Insight becomes material life.

Function:
Final corrective for bypass, inflation, abstraction, and cosmic escapism.

Label:

Make it real in life.